# BeThere cache control — prevents the blank-page-after-deploy bug.
#
# ROOT CAUSE: index.html references content-hashed JS/WASM whose filenames
# change every deploy. If a stale index.html is served (from edge or browser
# cache), it references asset hashes that the new deploy has purged → the
# <script>/<modulepreload> requests 404 → blank page, fixed only by a hard
# refresh that bypasses every cache. SRI (integrity="sha384-…") turns any
# stale-but-present asset into a hard failure too.
#
# FIX: never cache the version-critical shell/SW (force fresh on every load);
# cache content-hashed assets forever (their URL changes per build).

# Security headers for everything served asset-first. Since `run_worker_first`
# became an array (7ed1c07), every HTML navigation — `/`, `/ticket/*`, the SPA
# fallback — is answered from assets and never reaches the Worker's
# security_headers_layer, so without this block pages ship with no CSP, HSTS
# or X-Frame-Options. Source of truth: SECURITY_HEADERS in
# worker/src/middleware/headers.rs; worker/tests/security_headers_parity.rs
# fails if this block drifts from it. Matching rules merge, so the
# Cache-Control blocks below still apply.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-XSS-Protection: 0
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://unpkg.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://telegram.org; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; media-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; frame-src https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://oauth.telegram.org; connect-src 'self' https: wss:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

/
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age=0
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age=0
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age=0
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

# Content-hashed assets — filename changes per build, so long caching is safe.
/event-checkin-frontend-*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/event-checkin-frontend-*.wasm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/snippets/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/style-*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Vendored libraries carry their version in the filename (vendor/jsqr-1.4.0.js).
/jsqr-*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
